  "description": "The scorching sun. The golden desert and the blue sea! After working hard for 3 years, Kyu-Hyun goes on a trip to the African desert as a gift to himself. While trying to enjoy a healing life, Kyu-Hyun gets caught in a huge sandstorm and gets seriously injured, losing consciousness, and Neferti saves him. After a dreamlike kiss, he comes to his senses and wonders where he is?! And the animals are talking?!! Kyu-Hyun despairs when he hears that no one has returned to where they were, but he starts to get excited, wondering if he might meet the mysterious man who saved him...\n\n(Source: Peenutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 11 side story chapters.*",
